<html>
<title>Why does the COMX restart when I enter a DOS command?</title>
<body>

<h1>Why does the COMX restart when I enter a DOS command?</h1>

<p>
This is most likely due to skipping the <code>DOS NEW</code> command. After every <strong>Reset</strong>, you have to enter <code>DOS NEW</code> to reinitialize the COMX DOS.
</p>

</body>
</html>
